{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/856825-demon-dark-eras","id":856825,"title":"Demon Dark Eras","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-03-31T18:35:49-07:00","id":856825,"title":"Demon Dark Eras","content":"Hey! Has anyone picked this book up yet? I didn't get into the KS, but I plan on picking it up on official release. Still, I'm chomping at the bit for more information on the Cold War Berlin setting. Has anyone read through it? Is it good? Do you have any tidbits?<br /> <br /> I'm interested in the setting itself but even more interested in how I could take bits and pieces and incorporate them into Cold War or early post-Cold War Russia. Is there much there that would adapt well?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8492-dxanders","name":"dxanders","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"378"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-31T18:51:54-07:00","id":856837,"title":"","content":"I've got some great news for you, friend; you've been able to read that chapter for free since January of last year. The whole text of the book was posted when the Kickstarter went up.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B7FqViticwNuQ0ZZLTNDNTN5cG8/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B7FqViticwNuQ0ZZLTNDNTN5cG8/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B7FqViticwNuQ0ZZLTNDNTN5cG8/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B7FqViticwNuQ0ZZLTNDNTN5cG8/view?usp=sharing </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-31T19:08:09-07:00","id":856847,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/856825-demon-dark-eras?p=856837#post856837\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've got some great news for you, friend; you've been able to read that chapter for free since January of last year. The whole text of the book was posted when the Kickstarter went up.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B7FqViticwNuQ0ZZLTNDNTN5cG8/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B7F...ew?usp=sharing</a></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I knooooow. I don't really like reading in raw text, though, and I'm worried if I spoil myself by reading it, I'll never get around to buying the actual book. Then I'll feel guilty about it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I'd prefer some teases and maybe a micro-review if someone's game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8492-dxanders","name":"dxanders","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"378"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-31T20:12:17-07:00","id":856889,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>dxanders</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/856825-demon-dark-eras?p=856847#post856847\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I knooooow. I don't really like reading in raw text, though, and I'm worried if I spoil myself by reading it, I'll never get around to buying the actual book. Then I'll feel guilty about it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I'd prefer some teases and maybe a micro-review if someone's game.</div> </div> </div> </div>The long and short of it is that the God-Machine in Berlin took a beating during the war, which hasn't slowed the tide of Angels. Most of the Unchained in the city feel intense guilt over their tasks issued while still loyal. Much of the conflict is between Unchained factions; each Agenda gets numerous subgroups with their own schemes. The importance of Cover not only in the face of the God-Machine but under mortal scrutiny in a city full of spies and secret police is stressed. Several government-funded psychic programs show up.<br /> <br /> It's everything you'd want and expect, basically.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-31T21:31:26-07:00","id":856935,"title":"","content":"I personally like the era in central america, lots of interesting Infrastructure.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-31T23:45:43-07:00","id":856983,"title":"","content":"Agreed; the Aztec setting was a genuinely pleasant surprise.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-01T00:13:43-07:00","id":856994,"title":"","content":"I'm somewhere in the second part of the Aztec setting, and-disclosure time, this is actually probably the setting I know the most about personally. I cannot tell you how much research I have done on Meso-American cultures as a result of my missionary work and deciding that archaeology was a better hook than scripture (cause it really was).<br /> <br /> Oh my god, you guys, this is such a neat collision of accuracy and brevity. Not only does it tickle my particular historian bone on the subject, but it is also rife with the sort of setting details you need to play this game, so it also appeals to my &quot;What I want out of a setting&quot; bone.<br /> <br /> We'll have to see if it keeps delivering, but if it keeps pace, this is definitely going on my favorites list.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-01T01:17:09-07:00","id":857016,"title":"","content":"Yes, I'm glad that either someone liked my suggestion about aztec demon enough to back it, or someone else came up with the idea on their own and unlike me had money, because seriously, how is an aztecpunk demon game not a rocking concept? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> And as an added bonus, they made skinchanging a supernatural merit, which means one can now make shapeshifting stigmatics and demonbloods, which means that the skinchanger section is completely relevant to a demon aztec game too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-01T23:24:33-07:00","id":857531,"title":"","content":"Finished beneath the Skin-Excellent chapter on the whole. Easily in the pile of the best Eras of the bunch.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-03T21:14:30-07:00","id":858753,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/856825-demon-dark-eras?p=856994#post856994\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm somewhere in the second part of the Aztec setting, and-disclosure time, this is actually probably the setting I know the most about personally. I cannot tell you how much research I have done on Meso-American cultures as a result of my missionary work and deciding that archaeology was a better hook than scripture (cause it really was).<br /> <br /> Oh my god, you guys, this is such a neat collision of accuracy and brevity. Not only does it tickle my particular historian bone on the subject, but it is also rife with the sort of setting details you need to play this game, so it also appeals to my &quot;What I want out of a setting&quot; bone.<br /> <br /> We'll have to see if it keeps delivering, but if it keeps pace, this is definitely going on my favorites list.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> So AA, if one wanted to learn more in depth about the Mayans, could you recommend some books one might hunt for?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2244-nothri","name":"nothri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}